            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-m3-5e58c838c3.jpg",
            "title": "25-hour Battery Life, Longer Than You Need",
            "text": "<p>M3 lasts approximately 7.5 hrs on a single full charge and up to 25 hours with the charging case. So live your day to its fullest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-m3-9767ea3f5e.jpg",
            "title": "Improved Stability and Low Latency",
            "text": "<p>With 40nm ULP craftsmanship and a built-in 32-bit high-performance RISC-V chip, the M3 supports Digital Signal Processing and neural network accelerators. In addition, our integrated dual Bluetooth 5.2 offers ultra-distance transmission of more than 10 meters with low latency.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-m3-f44936ae50.jpg",
            "title": "IPX4 Waterproof",
            "text": "<p>Forget the water splash, sweat, and rain; even if you drop it in water, the M3 still works perfectly fine. The ESD anti-static protection design and OVP over-voltage protection chip provide extra protection for optimal durability.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
